msgctxt "field:product.price_list,currency:"
msgid "Currency"
msgstr "货币"

msgctxt "help:product.price_list,currency:"
msgid ""
"If a currency different from the company's is specified, the price will be "
"based on the price list, and the exchange rate of the currency will not be "
"applied."
msgstr "若指定的货币不同于公司货币，价格将以价格表为准，不应用货币汇率。"
